          <div class="post-content clearfix">
          <p>Fellow SDS’er @derekhubbard and his buddy @cschroll have been hosting a weekly Tuesday morning Code &amp; Coffee gathering at Caribou Coffee at The Greene in Kettering, OH.&#160; Tomorrow, Sept 22nd at 7:15am, we continue the SOLID principles.&#160; It’s a great way to start your day, so come by if you can make it.</p>

